              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.19.16+MAT.19.17+MAT.19.18+MAT.19.19+MAT.19.20+MAT.19.21+MAT.19.22+MAT.19.23+MAT.19.24+MAT.19.25+MAT.19.26+MAT.19.27+MAT.19.28+MAT.19.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 19:16-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.17+MRK.10.18+MRK.10.19+MRK.10.20+MRK.10.21+MRK.10.22+MRK.10.23+MRK.10.24+MRK.10.25+MRK.10.26+MRK.10.27+MRK.10.28+MRK.10.29+MRK.10.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mrk 10:17-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukuru w’isinagogi aramubaza, ati Mwigisha mwiza, nkore iki, ngo nze ndagwe ubugingo budashira? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aramubaza, at’ Unyitira iki mwiza? Nta mwiza atar’ umwe, ni we Mana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.12+EXO.20.13+EXO.20.14+EXO.20.15+EXO.20.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 20:12-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.16+DEU.5.17+DEU.5.18+DEU.5.19+DEU.5.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 5:16-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K’uzi ivyagezwe, ngo Ntugasambane, ntukice, ntukibe, ntukāgirize abandi ibinyoma, wubahe so na nyoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramubgira, at’ Ivyo vyose naravyitondeye, mpereye mu buto bganje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.6.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 6:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu avyumvise aramubgira, ati Na non’ uhajije kimwe; shōra ivy’ ufise vyose, ugabire aboro, ni ho uzogira itunga mw ijuru, utek’ uze, unkurikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze yumvise ivyo, arababara cane, kuko yar’ umutunzi cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amwitegereje aravuga, at’ Erega biragoye kw aba vyinshi binjira mu bgami bg’Imana! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw icoroshe ar’ ingamiya guca mu zuru ry’urushinge biruta umutunzi ko yinjira mu bgami bg’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abavyumvise baravuga, bati None rero, ni nde ashobora gukizwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ arababgira, at’ Ibidashobokera abantu bishobokera Imana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero aravuga, ati Rāba, twebge twaretse ivyacu, turagukurikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arababgira, ati Ndababgire ukuri, Nta waretse inzu, cank’ umugore, canke bene nyina, cank’ abavyeyi, cank’ abana, kubg’ ubgami bg’Imana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atazobishumbushwa umurengera mur’ iki gihe, no mu gihe kizoza atazohabga ubugingo budashira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
